        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;BitSummit 2024 Sponsor Award PlayStation®PRIZE, INNOVATIVE OUTLAW AWARD NOMINEE&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an adventure game where five protagonists—men and women who boarded the enigmatic talking elevator, &quot;Mr. Elevator&quot;—solve puzzles in a mysterious otherworld they are lost in, searching for what each of them seeks. Freely explore the unique world, drawn in the style of early Windows Paint software, and thoroughly enjoy the puzzles that appear before you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/f37e95ebd254cde03704e54fcb1b2e85.poster.avif?t=1771475590\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/f37e95ebd254cde03704e54fcb1b2e85.webm?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/f37e95ebd254cde03704e54fcb1b2e85.mp4?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm Mr. Elevator. <br>Are you looking for something?<br>If you're in trouble, I might be able to help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/e236773cabbfd75b609d73e7157839cd.poster.avif?t=1771475590\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/e236773cabbfd75b609d73e7157839cd.webm?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/e236773cabbfd75b609d73e7157839cd.mp4?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It seems that five men and women have wandered in here.<br>Are you... looking for someone?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/b33a719f78c51f3781da2fa4ee84e090.poster.avif?t=1771475590\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/b33a719f78c51f3781da2fa4ee84e090.webm?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many doors lined up. Let's try knocking or hitting them. <br>Oh, the door opened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/f024574f4d44d76d18b6347197ec62ef.poster.avif?t=1771475590\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/f024574f4d44d76d18b6347197ec62ef.webm?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/f024574f4d44d76d18b6347197ec62ef.mp4?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes you may walk in the dark,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/0d66a59fadc5b6f2d25d2a38762ca92f.poster.avif?t=1771475590\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/0d66a59fadc5b6f2d25d2a38762ca92f.webm?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/0d66a59fadc5b6f2d25d2a38762ca92f.mp4?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And in vast fields, you may encounter strange creatures or stone statues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/5431e7b35b5312646861be9eb2dbbef6.poster.avif?t=1771475590\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/5431e7b35b5312646861be9eb2dbbef6.webm?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/5431e7b35b5312646861be9eb2dbbef6.mp4?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Does a broken smartphone have any use?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/aaca21304299be41dfb7de7f4e026f38.poster.avif?t=1771475590\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/aaca21304299be41dfb7de7f4e026f38.webm?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/aaca21304299be41dfb7de7f4e026f38.mp4?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This looks good for turning screws.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/73a7aeae204af33d45a81b4d955923c6.poster.avif?t=1771475590\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/73a7aeae204af33d45a81b4d955923c6.webm?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/73a7aeae204af33d45a81b4d955923c6.mp4?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes you might hold a book and think about how to use the items you found,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/507afadcf9bc4cb2a84c2ddbb6131c95.poster.avif?t=1771475590\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/507afadcf9bc4cb2a84c2ddbb6131c95.webm?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387470/extras/507afadcf9bc4cb2a84c2ddbb6131c95.mp4?t=1771475590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And you might listen to a walkie-talkie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><vi